cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below. The article reference will be added on publication."
title: "Learnable ants: Self-generated state tokens as memory (code and data)"
abstract: >-
  Simulation platform, teacher corpus, trained models, per-seed results and
  figures for the study "Self-Generated State Tokens as Memory in Learnable
  Foraging Agents", in which small transformer ants speak their own control
  state in a 44-token foraging language and are compared with a
  parameter-matched GRU and a finite-state Bayesian filter, offline and in
  colonies that keep learning from their own successful trips.
type: software
